      "parameters": {
        "content": "Login Form → Gmail Notification Workflow\n\nThis n8n workflow is designed to create a simple login-style form and automatically send an email after the form is submitted.\n\nHow the workflow works:\n-> The workflow starts with the On Form Submission node. This node creates a form where the user enters their Name, Email ID, and Password. When the user clicks the Submit button, the form data is sent to the n8n workflow.\n\n-> The submitted information is then passed to the Gmail node. The Gmail node uses the email address provided in the form and sends a confirmation message to that email address.\n\n-> The email contains the user's name and a message confirming that the form was submitted successfully.",
